  hints:
  - "Scarlet is already up on the ledge. Dani is stuck at a gap below. Each controls something the other needs."
  - "Scarlet must stand on the stone plate to extend the bridge for Dani. Scarlet must stay on the plate until Dani crosses."
  - "Scarlet stands on the plate to extend Dani's bridge. Dani crosses and pulls the lever to open Scarlet's gate. Scarlet steps off the ledge north and walks through. Both reach the glowing circle."
